flowchart TD
  A[Authenticated admin or trusted scheduler] --> B[Validate sources and approved domains]
  B --> C[Collect short summaries and links]
  C --> D[Deduplicate and verify source eligibility]
  D --> E[Generate original Tamil script]
  E --> F[Validate facts and source references]
  F --> G{Sensitive or restricted content?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Explicit admin approve or reject]
  H -->|Reject| I[Rejected - never playable]
  H -->|Approve| J[Approved draft]
  G -->|No| J
  J --> K[Queued Sarvam synthesis with retries]
  K --> L[Decode and mix audio - validate output]
  L --> M[Private audio until publish]
  M --> N[Schedule for correct city and show]
  N --> O[Publish only reviewed audio-ready episode]
  O --> P[Listener playback with source links]
